{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Paladin Engrave your gloves with the Crusader Strike rune: \"Learn a new ability after unleashing 10 seals onto your enemies\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="inv_relics_libramofhope",["id"]=205420,["level"]=1.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Libram of Judgement",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Drop","Vendor"},["sources"]={"Drops","Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=7,["subtype"]="Libram"},
{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Shaman Engrave your chest or robe with the Overload rune: Gives your Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning spells a 30% chance to cast a second, similar spell on the same target at no additional cost that causes half damage and no threat. \"Learn a new ability after receiving Nature damage 10 times.\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="inv_relics_totemoflife",["id"]=206381,["level"]=1.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Dyadic Icon",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Drop","Vendor"},["sources"]={"Drops","Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=9,["subtype"]="Totem"},
{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Shaman Engrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune: The caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water. When a spell, melee, or ranged attack hits the caster or when one of the caster's spells gets a critical result, 2% of maximum mana is restored to the caster, expending one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts 10 min. Only one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time. \"Learn a new ability after hitting 10 non-player enemies with 3 different elements (Nature, Frost, Fire).\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="spell_fireresistancetotem_01",["id"]=206382,["level"]=10.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Tempest Icon",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Drop","Vendor"},["sources"]={"Drops","Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=9,["subtype"]="Totem"},
{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Shaman Engrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune: Each time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value. In addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond (60 * 5). Lasts 15 sec. \"Learn a new ability after defeating enemies 10 times with Lightning Bolt.\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="inv_relics_totemoflife",["id"]=206386,["level"]=1.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Galvanic Icon",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Vendor"},["sources"]={"Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=9,["subtype"]="Totem"},
{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Shaman Engrave your gloves with the Lava Burst rune: You hurl molten lava at the target, dealing 114 to 145 Fire damage. If your Flame Shock is on the target, Lava Burst deals 20% increased damage. \"Learn a new ability after taking damage from lava 5 times. (Reduces damage from some sources of lava)\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="inv_relics_totemofrebirth",["id"]=206387,["level"]=25.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Kajaric Icon",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Drop","Vendor"},["sources"]={"Drops","Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=9,["subtype"]="Totem"},
{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Shaman Engrave your gloves with the Molten Blast rune: Blast up to 10 enemies in a cone in front of you for [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * 72 / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] to [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * 108 / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] Fire damage. This ability generates a high amount of threat. Flame Shock periodic damage has a 10% chance to reset the cooldown on Molten Blast. \"Learn a new ability after defeating 10 enemies with Earth Shock.\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="inv_relics_totemoflife",["id"]=206388,["level"]=1.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Sulfurous Icon",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Drop","Vendor"},["sources"]={"Drops","Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=9,["subtype"]="Totem"},
{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Druid Engrave your gloves with the Mangle rune: Bite the target, dealing 100% normal damage plus 42 and generating a high amount of threat. \"Learn a new ability after keeping your rage in Bear Form at 50 or higher for 60 seconds\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="spell_nature_natureresistancetotem",["id"]=206954,["level"]=10.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Idol of Ursine Rage",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Drop","Vendor"},["sources"]={"Drops","Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=8,["subtype"]="Idol"},
{["bind"]="pickup",["bosses"]={},["classID"]=4,["classes"]="Druid Engrave your chest or robe with the Fury of Stormrage rune: Reduces the mana cost of Wrath by 100% and each time you deal damage with Wrath you have a 12% chance for your next cast of Healing Touch within 15 sec to be instant and castable in any shapeshift form. Allows Wrath to be cast while in Tree of Life form. \"Defeat 6 creatures affected by your Moonfire, then use to learn a new ability.\" Added in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",["effects"]=true,["equipLoc"]="INVTYPE_RELIC",["icon"]="inv_qirajidol_night",["id"]=208414,["level"]=5.0,["minLevel"]=nil,["name"]="Lunar Idol",["quality"]=2.0,["restrictions"]=true,["sourceTypes"]={"Drop","Vendor"},["sources"]={"Drops","Vendors"},["stats"]={},["subclassID"]=8,["subtype"]="Idol"},
